  "notes": "Mid-tier neutral client. Egypt controls the Rafah crossing into Gaza and is a guarantor and mediator of the Gaza ceasefire; it is expected to train Palestinian police for post-war Gaza. ISIS Sinai Province is much weakened but still a map threat. Houthi attacks in the Red Sea cut Suez Canal revenue, so Egypt is hostile to them without joining strikes. Egypt condemned Iranian strikes on Jordan in 2026 but has kept out of the Iran war. Deployed troops to AUSSOM in Somalia. Large, mixed arsenal: US, Russian, Chinese, French, German, Korean.",
